start=\"5803\" data-end=\"5866\"><p data-start=\"5805\" data-end=\"5866\"><a href=\"https:\/\/www.breedj.com\/fr\/portage-salarial-international\/\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener\">Des services Employer of Record (EOR)<\/a> dans 9 pays africains<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"5867\" data-end=\"5917\"><p data-start=\"5869\" data-end=\"5917\">La gestion compl\u00e8te de la paie et des contrats<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"5918\" data-end=\"5971\"><p data-start=\"5920\" data-end=\"5971\">Des talents v\u00e9rifi\u00e9s techniquement et humainement<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"5972\" data-end=\"6004\"><p data-start=\"5974\" data-end=\"6004\">Un accompagnement RH continu<\/p><\/li><li data-start=\"6005\" data-end=\"6046\"><p data-start=\"6007\" data-end=\"6046\">Des processus d\u2019onboarding structur\u00e9s<\/p><\/li><\/ul><p data-start=\"6048\" data-end=\"6152\">Les entreprises peuvent ainsi recruter sans cr\u00e9er d\u2019entit\u00e9 locale, tout en restant pleinement conformes.<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-7b24024 elementor-widget elementor-widget-text-editor\" data-id=\"7b24024\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"text-editor.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<h3>\u00a0<\/h3><h3 style=\"text-align: center;\">Breedj permet aux entreprises d\u2019acc\u00e9der rapidement \u00e0 des ing\u00e9nieurs IA africains, sans complexit\u00e9 juridique ni risque op\u00e9rationnel.<\/h3><p>\u00a0<\/p>\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<\/div>\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-element elementor-element-05550d8 elementor-align-center elementor-widget elementor-widget-button\" data-id=\"05550d8\" data-element_type=\"widget\" data-e-type=\"widget\" data-widget_type=\"button.default\">\n\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-widget-container\">\n\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t\t<div class=\"elementor-button-wrapper\">\n\t\t\t\t\t<a class=\"elementor-button eleme